  "clause_1_scope": "This Indian Standard (IS 13863) covers Cereals and milled cereal products - Determination of viscosity of flour - Method using an amylograph. This Indian Standard which Is identical with ISO 7973 : 1932 'Cereals and milled cereal products — Determination of the viscosity of flour — Method using an amylograph' issued by the International Organization for Standardization ( ISO ) was adopted by the In the adopted standard certain terminology and conventions are not identical with those used in Indian Standards; attention is drawn specially to the following: a) Wherever the words 'International Standard' appear referring to this standard, they should be read as 'Indian Standard'; and b) Comma ( , ) has been used as a decimal marker, while in Indian Standard the current practice is to use a point ( . ) as the decimal marker. CROSS REFERENCES In this adopted standard, reference appears to certain International Standards for which Indian Standards also exist. The corresponding Indian Standards which are to be substituted in their place are iisted beiow aiong with their degree of equivalence for the editions indicated: international",
